{
  "_about": "Card layouts by camera brand. Lunelis picks the first profile whose markers exist on the card, else 'generic'. media_dirs are read recursively; skip_dirs never; sidecars (non-photo files such as .XML, .XMP, .AAE) and companions (photos or videos that belong to another, such as a Live Photo's .MOV) are copied, verified and filed with the file they belong to - a companion is never split from it. Add your own in <data folder>/camera_profiles.json (same shape; same id replaces a built-in).",
